          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of an opaque white light ball moving through a forest and then positioning itself in front of the vehicle; instantaneous disappearance: observations of a ball lightning-type \"globular lightning\".",
